{
  "computation": "jet-lifted-hecke",
  "description": "Multi-level jet-tower binding with V\u0302 propagation at each jet level via one of two stub lifts: (a) Markov-stabilization V\u0302^(n) = z^n V\u0302^(0); (b) q-Plancherel-descent geometric decay.  Both converge to the single-level all-pairs result at N=1 (level 0 only), and extrapolate to the geometric sum at higher N.  True jet-lifted K\u00e4hler-differential propagation is not implemented \u2014 requires the explicit \u03a9^1(H_n(q)) action which is open in the repo.",
